EXCHANGE 1
    X 0.05
    -equilibrate with solution 1

SOLUTION 1
    units ppm
    pH 7.2
    pe 4.0
    density 1.0
    Ca 80.0
    Mg 24.0
    Na 23.0
    K 3.0
    Alkalinity 200 as CaCO3
    Cl 35.0
    S(6) 50.0
    Fe 0.1
    Mn 0.05

REACTION 1
    NaCl 1.0
    0.3 moles in 30 steps

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected_output.txt
    -reset true
    -step true
    -pH
    -pe
    -si Calcite
    -si Dolomite
    -si Gypsum
    -si Halite
    -totals Ca
    -totals Mg
    -totals Na
    -totals K
    -totals Cl

END